      "sc:description": "GenoGra is an integrated bioinformatics workbench for pangenomic data analysis. It combines custom-based analysis workflows, graph-based pangenomic approaches, and interactive visualization tools in a unified environment, supporting efficient exploration and interpretation of complex genomic datasets.",
